  "description": "Pure-C# port of the ZArchive 0.1.2 library: directory-tree archives with per-block zstd compression (levels 1-22, raw fallback for incompressible blocks). Includes a dependency-free RFC 8878 zstd encoder and decoder. BCL-only, trimmable, and AOT-compatible.",
  "iconFile": "zar.png",
